    "rationale": "The evidence shows a high-velocity, coordinated brute-force and credential stuffing campaign originating from three distinct IPs confirmed to be malicious threat infrastructure. A total of 90 login attempts targeting 18 usernames (including SQL injection and XSS payloads) were executed in approximately 7 seconds, all resulting in 401 failures with zero successful logins. Despite the lack of successful breaches, the verified malicious reputation of all source IPs, the automated distributed nature of the botnet, and the aggressive request rate warrant a High severity rating and immediate escalation for security intervention.",
